{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1001_p", "source_sha256": "47456d406b1435a47e7cb0521ea340f89cdb7a5af7f05693ee2f8a9137e36a01", "ja": "未来？　なんだかずいぶん\n疲れてるみたいだけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "未来？你看起来好累，\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
