{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1003_p", "source_sha256": "124747d29f56c75f55179cbd4fa270d91528f53a2fb7422e6a0e5135fa860f7b", "ja": "ああ、チームに別れて対決するやつだったか。\nそれがどうかしたのか？", "zh": "嗯，分队对抗的那个节目吧？\n有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "d6bc38d5e3f14e901d1f911f50c9290d2f4666b05834c5faf2044bdd9b5645c4", "ja": "あの時、いーっぱい走ったり闘ったりして、\nまだ筋肉痛なんです……。", "zh": "我在节目上一直跑步、对决，\n今天还在肌肉酸痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "c4c71e8bae706d34e37328cb6de47891f2cd7af76d438ec30a0aafa3c3469756", "ja": "なので、{$P$}さん！\n生クリームを食べに連れていってください！", "zh": "所以说，{$P$}先生！\n请带我去吃鲜奶油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1006_p", "source_sha256": "8d76d27fdaf523014706f971ffa301b8239b3860b3967b57abd2b7059643f441", "ja": "生クリーム？　筋肉痛に生クリームが効くなんて、\n聞いた事がないような……。", "zh": "鲜奶油？我怎么不知道\n鲜奶油能治肌肉酸痛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "057346e1485008c78c2b8a5ea902dff1f7b75d8dd0c27f868a93328ee098de84", "ja": "{$P$}さ～ん……\n生クリーム～……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n鲜奶油～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1008_p", "source_sha256": "95c199c224058b1b826363ade2f74382ba80ef09358345e2e630a980d3bf263b", "ja": "わ、わかったわかった、生クリームだな。\nロケも頑張っていたことだし、連れて行くよ！", "zh": "好、好啦好啦，鲜奶油是吧。\n看在你录影时那么努力的份上，我带你去吃就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0052_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0052_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "4aa4f754664f337fd0cd9c96502dd105dc47b6bdbc1db3c0216def01817d6a31", "ja": "やったー！\n生クリーム、楽しみだな～！　でへへ♪", "zh": "太好了──！\n真想快点吃到鲜奶油～！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
